00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,096
Here is the whole comparison.

2
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:03,658
Two steps against one.

3
00:00:03,658 --> 00:00:07,213
Rate depending on the haloalkane only, against both.

4
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:10,299
A carbocation against no intermediate.

5
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:12,760
Racemisation against inversion.

6
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:20,000
Tertiary halides favour S N one, methyl and primary favour S N two.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,598
Weak nucleophiles and protic solvents like water favour S N one.

8
00:00:25,598 --> 00:00:31,979
Strong nucleophiles and aprotic solvents like acetone favour S N two.

